# === Data (downloaded/generated — not tracked in git) ===
# data/raw/ is intentionally tracked so the Docker image ships with
# pre-downloaded documents (avoids geo-blocked / flaky re-downloads on Railway)
# data/chroma/ is intentionally tracked so Railway loads pre-built vectors
# (Railway free tier OOMs during CPU embedding, so we pre-compute locally)
data/parsed/
data/chunks/

